cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Carquet: a pure C library for reading and writing Apache Parquet files"
abstract: >-
  Carquet is a dependency-light, pure C library for reading and writing Apache
  Parquet files, with SIMD-optimized encoders/decoders for x86 (SSE/AVX2/AVX-512)
  and ARM (NEON/SVE), zstd/zlib/Snappy/LZ4/Brotli compression, nested data with an
  Arrow C Data Interface bridge, and parallel column reading and writing.
type: software
